        "line": 6,
        "text": "# Data Visualization"
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": "Create clear, accessible, and impactful data visualizations. This skill covers principles for designing charts, graphs, dashboards, and infographics that make data easy to understand and act on."
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "**What is Data Visualization?**"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "Data visualization is the practice of representing information visually, turning numbers, statistics, and data into charts, graphs, maps, and other visual formats that help people understand patterns, trends, and insights."
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "## When to Use Data Visualization"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "Create data visualizations when you need to:"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": "- **Build dashboards** with charts and graphs"
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "- **Create infographics** that tell a data story"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "- **Design analytics interfaces** for tracking metrics"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "- **Show relationships** between data points (network diagrams, correlation charts)"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "- **Display geographic data** (maps, choropleths)"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": "- **Present trends over time** (line charts, area charts)"
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "- **Compare values** (bar charts, column charts)"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "- **Show distributions** (histograms, box plots)"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "## Core Principles"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "### 1. Data-First Design"
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "- Understand the data structure before designing"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "- Let the data inform the visualization type"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "- Consider data updates and transitions"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "### 2. Visual Encoding"
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "- **Position**: Most accurate (x/y axes)"
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "- **Length**: Bar charts, comparisons"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "- **Angle**: Pie charts (use sparingly)"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "- **Area**: Bubble charts"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "- **Color**: Categories, gradients for values"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "### 3. Accessibility"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "- Don't rely solely on color"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "- Add labels and tooltips"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "- Ensure keyboard navigation"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "- Provide text alternatives"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "## Chart Selection Guide"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": "| Data Type | Recommended Chart |"
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "|-----------|------------------|"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": "| Comparison | Bar, Column |"
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": "| Trend over time | Line, Area |"
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "| Part-to-whole | Stacked bar, Treemap |"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": "| Distribution | Histogram, Box plot |"
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "| Relationship | Scatter, Network |"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "| Geographic | Map, Choropleth |"
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": "## Choosing the Right Chart Type"
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "**Start with your question**: What do you want to communicate?"
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "- **\"How much?\"** \u2192 Bar chart, column chart"
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": "- **\"Over time?\"** \u2192 Line chart, area chart"
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": "- **\"Parts of a whole?\"** \u2192 Pie chart, stacked bar, treemap"
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": "- **\"How are things related?\"** \u2192 Scatter plot, bubble chart"
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": "- **\"Where?\"** \u2192 Map, choropleth"
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "- **\"How is data distributed?\"** \u2192 Histogram, box plot"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": "**Common Tools:**"
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": "- **D3.js**: Powerful JavaScript library for custom visualizations"
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "- **Chart.js, Recharts, Victory**: Easier-to-use charting libraries"
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": "- **Tableau, Power BI**: Business intelligence tools"
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": "- **Figma, Illustrator**: For custom-designed infographics"
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "## Implementation Pattern (D3.js Example)"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": "```javascript"
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": "// Standard D3 pattern for custom visualizations"
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": "const svg = d3.select(\"#chart\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "  .append(\"svg\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "  .attr(\"viewBox\", [0, 0, width, height]);"
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": "// Scales map data values to visual space"
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "const x = d3.scaleLinear()"
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": "  .domain(d3.extent(data, d => d.value))"
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": "  .range([0, width]);"
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "// Data binding: join data to DOM elements"
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": "svg.selectAll(\"rect\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": "  .data(data)"
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": "  .join(\"rect\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": "  .attr(\"x\", d => x(d.value))"
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": "  .attr(\"height\", d => y(d.category));"
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": "## Design Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": "### Color Palettes"
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "- Use colorbrewer2.org for accessible palettes"
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "- Limit to 5-7 colors for categories"
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "- Use sequential palettes for continuous data"
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 101,
        "text": "### Typography"
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": "- 12-14px for labels"
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": "- 16-18px for titles"
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "- Use tabular figures for numbers"
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "- Ensure contrast ratio \u2265 4.5:1"
      },
      {
        "line": 106,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 107,
        "text": "### Interactions"
      },
      {
        "line": 108,
        "text": "- Hover states for details"
      },
      {
        "line": 109,
        "text": "- Click to filter/focus"
      },
      {
        "line": 110,
        "text": "- Smooth transitions (300-500ms)"
      },
      {
        "line": 111,
        "text": "- Provide undo/reset options"
      },
      {
        "line": 112,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 113,
        "text": "### Responsive Design"
      },
      {
        "line": 114,
        "text": "- Use viewBox for scaling"
      },
      {
        "line": 115,
        "text": "- Adjust tick counts at breakpoints"
      },
      {
        "line": 116,
        "text": "- Consider mobile-specific layouts"
      },
      {
        "line": 117,
        "text": "- Touch-friendly targets (44px min)"
      },
      {
        "line": 118,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 119,
        "text": "## Data Visualization Best Practices"
      },
      {
        "line": 120,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 121,
        "text": "**Show the data clearly:**"
      },
      {
        "line": 122,
        "text": "- Remove unnecessary decoration (chart junk)"
      },
      {
        "line": 123,
        "text": "- Use consistent scales and axes"
      },
      {
        "line": 124,
        "text": "- Label axes and data points clearly"
      },
      {
        "line": 125,
        "text": "- Provide context (what does this mean?)"
      },
      {
        "line": 126,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 127,
        "text": "**Make it accessible:**"
      },
      {
        "line": 128,
        "text": "- Use sufficient color contrast"
      },
      {
        "line": 129,
        "text": "- Don't rely on color alone to convey meaning"
      },
      {
        "line": 130,
        "text": "- Add text labels and descriptions"
      },
      {
        "line": 131,
        "text": "- Provide alternative text for charts"
      },
      {
        "line": 132,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 133,
        "text": "**Help users explore:**"
      },
      {
        "line": 134,
        "text": "- Add interactive tooltips with details"
      },
      {
        "line": 135,
        "text": "- Allow filtering and drilling down"
      },
      {
        "line": 136,
        "text": "- Show related data on hover"
      },
      {
        "line": 137,
        "text": "- Provide clear legends and keys"
      },
      {
        "line": 138,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 139,
        "text": "## Common Patterns"
      },
      {
        "line": 140,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 141,
        "text": "### Tooltips"
      },
      {
        "line": 142,
        "text": "```javascript"
      },
      {
        "line": 143,
        "text": "element.on(\"mouseenter\", (event, d) => {"
      },
      {
        "line": 144,
        "text": "  tooltip"
      },
      {
        "line": 145,
        "text": "    .style(\"opacity\", 1)"
      },
      {
        "line": 146,
        "text": "    .html(`Value: ${d.value}`)"
      },
      {
        "line": 147,
        "text": "    .style(\"left\", event.pageX + \"px\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 148,
        "text": "    .style(\"top\", event.pageY + \"px\");"
      },
      {
        "line": 149,
        "text": "});"
      },
      {
        "line": 150,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 151,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "### Transitions"
      },
      {
        "line": 153,
        "text": "```javascript"
      },
      {
        "line": 154,
        "text": "bars.transition()"
      },
      {
        "line": 155,
        "text": "  .duration(400)"
      },
      {
        "line": 156,
        "text": "  .attr(\"height\", d => y(d.value));"
      },
      {
        "line": 157,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 158,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 159,
        "text": "### Responsive"
      },
      {
        "line": 160,
        "text": "```javascript"
      },
      {
        "line": 161,
        "text": "const resize = () => {"
      },
      {
        "line": 162,
        "text": "  const width = container.clientWidth;"
      },
      {
        "line": 163,
        "text": "  svg.attr(\"width\", width);"
      },
      {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "  x.range([0, width - margin.left - margin.right]);"
      },
      {
        "line": 165,
        "text": "  // Update elements"
      },
      {
        "line": 166,
        "text": "};"
      },
      {
        "line": 167,
        "text": "window.addEventListener(\"resize\", resize);"
      },
      {
        "line": 168,
        "text": "```"
      }
    ],
